Third-party notices for the gnosis wasm bundles

The query client and the PDF extraction bundle are compiled from gnosis (MIT;
see LICENSE) and statically link the crates below, which are the query client's
dependency graph — the extraction bundle links a subset of it, so this file
covers both. Each license is followed by its text as the crates ship it. A
crate that ships no license file gets the license's standard text; its authors,
listed with it, are the copyright holders.

